; Cross-scope requested-element DEP spec (`--wrapper-requests` host side). The dep OWNS `scoped_foo`
; but defines it in a NON-ROOT scope (`sub/module.cddl` -> the `sub::module` scope, reachable
; externally as `wr_dep::sub::module::ScopedFoo`). Crucially, `root` references NOTHING scoped, so the
; generated wasm ROOT never imports `ScopedFoo` for its own sake — a hosted `[2*2 scoped_foo]` request
; therefore cannot resolve either its element or its own-spec loose `ScopedFooList` source through
; the module's bare `use super::*;` (which reaches only the generated root), pinning that the
; request-collections import walk uses their true `crate::generated::sub::module` home.
root = [a: uint]
